#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3337
msgid ""
"Reload the currently displayed document"
"<p>This may, for example, be needed to refresh webpages that have been "
"modified since they were loaded, in order to make the changes visible."
msgstr ""
"Ail-lwytho'r ddogfen arddangosedig cyfredol"
"<p>Gall bod angen hwn i adfywio tudalennau gwê, er enghraifft rhai sydd "
"wedi eu addasu ers eu llwytho, er mwyn dangos y newidiadau."

#: konq_mainwindow.cc:3340
msgid "Reload the currently displayed document"
